WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,960
Sir, we are not fighting.

2
00:00:01,960 --> 00:00:05,320
It's because they don't want to do it themselves, you're talking nonsense

3
00:00:05,320 --> 00:00:10,660
It's you who want to drive us away

4
00:00:10,660 --> 00:00:11,580
Stop talking

5
00:00:11,580 --> 00:00:12,900
let's go

6
00:00:12,900 --> 00:00:14,660
Don't get the managers into trouble

7
00:00:16,880 --> 00:00:18,840
What did you do before?

8
00:00:22,450 --> 00:00:24,770
We are researchers at the institute. This is our Professor Wang.

9
00:00:24,770 --> 00:00:26,210
Very famous and has produced many achievements

10
00:00:26,210 --> 00:00:27,250
Research or something

11
00:00:27,250 --> 00:00:30,470
Polymer materials

12
00:00:30,470 --> 00:00:33,310
Manager, thank you for saving us

13
00:00:33,310 --> 00:00:35,420
Leave us alone

14
00:00:35,420 --> 00:00:38,020
We won't give the base any trouble.

15
00:00:38,020 --> 00:00:39,420
You all follow me

16
00:00:39,420 --> 00:00:40,980
I'll let you continue your research in the future.

17
00:00:40,980 --> 00:00:43,220
Meat every meal

18
00:00:43,220 --> 00:00:45,700
Sir, are you going to build a research institute?

19
00:00:45,700 --> 00:00:47,420
Okay, the base finally needs us.

20
00:00:47,420 --> 00:00:49,410
Not a base

21
00:00:49,410 --> 00:00:51,030
I want you

22
00:00:51,030 --> 00:00:53,470
I'm the leader of the remaining bases

23
00:00:53,470 --> 00:00:55,470
I'll take you to the rest of my base.
